  'Ondata di Magia Selvaggia': 'Your magic is untameable and chaotic.\n\n- Every time you cast a sorcerer spell of 1st level or higher, the DM may ask you to roll a d20.\n- On a 1 (or if you have used Tides of Chaos), you roll on the Wild Magic Surge table to create a random, explosive magical effect.',
  'Onde di Caos': 'You can manipulate the forces of chance to gain Advantage on one attack roll, ability check or saving throw.\n\n- Once used, you must finish a long rest before using it again.\n- However, before the end of that rest, if you cast a sorcerer spell of 1st level or higher, the DM can have you roll on the Wild Magic table: as soon as you do, you immediately regain the use of Tides of Chaos.',
  'Piega la Sorte': 'You can twist fate in your favour or against your enemies. When a creature you can see within 18 metres makes an attack roll, an ability check or a saving throw, you can use your reaction and spend 1 to 3 Sorcery Points to roll that many d4s and add or subtract the total from the creature’s roll.',
  'Caos Controllato': 'You gain a measure of control over your bursts of arcane chaos. Whenever you roll on the Wild Magic Surge table, you can roll twice and choose which of the two effects to apply.',
  'Bombardamento Magico': 'Chaotic energy suffuses your spells with destructive force. When you roll damage for a spell and get the maximum value on any of the dice, you can choose one of those dice, reroll it and add the result to the spell’s total damage (once per turn).',
  'Resilienza Draconica': 'Draconic magic flows through your body, making it tougher.\n\n- Your Hit Point maximum increases by 3, and by 1 more for each sorcerer level you gain thereafter.\n- Parts of your body are also covered by a thin layer of dragon scales: while you are not wearing armour, your Armour Class equals **13 + your Dexterity modifier**.',
  'Incantesimi Draconici': 'Your bloodline grants you specific spells tied to the nature of dragons (e.g. Command, Shield, Spike Growth, Fly) that are always prepared and do not count against your maximum prepared spells.',
  'Affinità Elementale': 'When you cast a spell that deals damage of the type associated with your draconic ancestor (acid, cold, fire, lightning or poison), you can add your Charisma modifier to one damage roll of that spell. You can also spend 1 Sorcery Point to gain Resistance to that damage type for 1 hour.',
  'Ali di Drago': 'As a bonus action you can sprout a pair of magical draconic wings from your back, gaining a flying speed equal to your walking speed. The wings last until you dismiss them with a bonus action.',
  'Compagno Draconico': 'You embody the majestic terror of ancient dragons. As an action you can spend 5 Sorcery Points to radiate an 18-metre aura of terror or awe for 1 minute, forcing hostile creatures to make a Wisdom saving throw.',
  'Linguaggio Telepatico': 'You can establish telepathic contact with a creature you can see within 9 metres. The communication is two-way and lasts a number of minutes equal to your sorcerer level.',
  'Incantesimi Psionici': 'Your mind, touched by the Far Realm, grants you psionic spells (e.g. Evard’s Black Tentacles, Detect Thoughts, Hold Person) that are always prepared for you.',
  'Stregoneria Psionica': 'When you cast a spell from your Psionic Spells list, you can cast it by spending Sorcery Points equal to the slot level instead of using a spell slot. If you do, the spell requires no verbal, somatic or material component (unless it is consumed).',
  'Difese Psichiche': 'Your alien mind is impenetrable to ordinary mortals. You gain Resistance to psychic damage and Advantage on saving throws against the Charmed and Frightened conditions.',
  'Rivelazione nella Carne': 'As a bonus action you can spend 1 or more Sorcery Points to transform your body for 10 minutes, gaining benefits such as magical darkvision, a swimming or flying speed, or a pliable body able to squeeze through 2.5 cm gaps.',
  'Implosione Distorcente': 'As an action you can unleash warping gravity from your body, teleporting up to 36 metres to an empty space you can see and forcing creatures within 9 metres of your starting point to take 3d10 force damage and be pulled towards that point.',
  'Magia Meccanica': 'You draw on the cosmic order of Mechanus, gaining spells tied to law, balance and calculation (e.g. Magic Weapon, Shield, Aid) that are always prepared.',
  'Ripristinare l’Equilibrio': 'When a creature you can see within 18 metres is about to make a d20 roll with Advantage or Disadvantage, you can use your reaction and spend 1 Sorcery Point to cancel it out, forcing a single normal d20 roll.',
